## **1. OFFICIAL BENCHMARK SUITES & PERFORMANCE DOCUMENTATION**

### **TensorFlow Official Resources:**
- **TensorFlow Benchmarks Repository**: https://github.com/tensorflow/benchmarks
  - Official benchmarks for model performance across hardware
  - CPU, GPU, and TPU performance measurements
  - Containerized benchmark environment

- **TensorFlow Performance Documentation**: https://www.tensorflow.org/guide/performance
  - Official optimization guides
