- **PyTorch Benchmarking Repository**: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/tree/master/torch/utils/benchmark
  - Built-in benchmarking utilities
  - Microbenchmark tools in torchbenchmark: https://github.com/pytorch/benchmark

- **PyTorch Performance Tuning Guide**: https://pytorch.org/tutorials/recipes/recipes/tuning_guide.html
  - Official optimization recommendations
  - Hardware-specific performance tips
  - Memory optimization strategies

